WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:11.511
The Entity Profiler maps documented actors to their actions, financial vectors, and institutional connections — each card colour-coded by risk level and clickable to reveal a full timeline of sourced events.

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:20.511
This is not speculation; it's a programmable profiling dashboard built from lobbying registries, campaign finance disclosures, and Ethics Commissioner findings.

00:00:20.511 --> 00:00:27.363
Every entity displayed here earned their place through the public record, and every connection is documented with primary sources.
